{{> studentTop}}
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="muted">Browse your course and module awards.</p></div></div><div class="notice info">Pass a module assessment in a certificate-enabled course to earn its badge and certificate. Open a badge or certificate to see its details. Direct source citations are not an eligibility requirement. Stars reflect the assessment score: 75–84% = 1, 85–94% = 2, 95–100% = 3.</div>
{{#if pendingAwards}}<section class="card space-top"><h2>Completed courses awaiting certificate setup</h2><p class="small muted">Your course completion is saved. A certificate is issued automatically when all published course requirements are met.</p>{{#each pendingAwards}}<p class="assignment-item"><strong>{{title}}</strong><span>Completed {{date}} · eligibility check pending</span></p>{{/each}}</section>{{/if}}<div data-page-list>{{#each awardGroups}}<details class="card course-disclosure space-top" data-page-item><summary>{{title}}</summary><div class="course-awards"><section><h3>Course badge</h3><button type="button" class="button" data-open-award="course-badge-{{courseId}}">View course badge</button><p>{{earnedModules.length}} modules represented</p></section><section><h3>Earned certificates</h3><div data-page-list>{{#each certificates}}<article class="feedback-item" data-page-item><h4>{{#if moduleTitle}}{{moduleTitle}}{{else}}Course completion{{/if}}</h4><p>Issued {{date}}</p><a class="button secondary" data-download-certificate="/student/credentials/{{id}}/certificate" href="/student/credentials/{{id}}/certificate?view=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View &amp; download</a></article>{{/each}}</div></section></div>
<dialog id="course-badge-{{courseId}}" class="card award-dialog" aria-labelledby="course-badge-title-{{courseId}}"><form method="dialog"><button class="button secondary">Close</button></form><p class="eyebrow">Course badge</p><h2 id="course-badge-title-{{courseId}}">{{title}}</h2><span class="award-badge" aria-hidden="true">{{> icon name="award"}}</span><p>Skills from passed modules with earned credentials.</p><div data-page-list>{{#each earnedModules}}<section class="feedback-item" data-page-item><h3>{{moduleTitle}}</h3><p>Assessment {{score}}% · Passed</p><ul>{{#each skills}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{else}}<li>No skills listed for this module.</li>{{/each}}</ul><a class="text-link" href="/verify/{{id}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify module achievement →</a></section>{{else}}<p>Course completion awarded. No separate module credentials recorded.</p>{{/each}}</div></dialog></details>{{else}}<section class="card empty">No earned achievements yet. Pass a module assessment in a certificate-enabled course to earn an award.</section>{{/each}}</div>
<section class="card space-top"><h2>Completion & improvement history</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Course</th><th>First / latest completion</th><th>Passed completions</th><th>Repeat completions</th><th>Latest / best final knowledge score</th></tr></thead><tbody data-page-list>{{#each completionHistory}}<tr data-page-item><td>{{title}}</td><td>{{first}}<small>{{latest}}</small></td><td>{{completions}}</td><td>{{repeats}}</td><td>{{latestScore}}% / {{best}}%</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Complete your first course to start your history.</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div></section><section class="card space-top"><h2>Published award criteria</h2><p>1 star: course passing score to 84% · 2 stars: 85–94% · 3 stars: 95–100%. Practical courses use the published weighted grade. A course can be completed once; after that, you can review it but cannot start another attempt.</p></section>{{> studentBottom}}

